<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow"><%= brandLong %></span>
      <h1>The standard for trusted training credentials.</h1>
      <p><%= brand %> accredits training providers and gives employers an instant, official way to confirm that a certificate is authentic, current and issued by an accredited organization.</p>
      <form class="hero-search" action="/verify" method="get">
        <input name="id" placeholder="Enter Certificate ID, e.g. LIV-2026-7KQ4M9XZ" aria-label="Certificate ID" autocomplete="off" required>
        <button class="btn gold lg">Verify Certificate</button>
      </form>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn ghost" href="/accreditation">Become an Accredited Provider →</a></div>
      <div class="trust"><span>Tamper-evident records</span><span>Instant QR verification</span><span>Real-time revocation</span><span>Bulk &amp; API issuance</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-seal"><img src="/static/brand/liv-seal-reverse.svg" alt="<%= brand %> official seal" width="340" height="340"></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band">
  <div class="container band-grid">
    <div><strong>Independent</strong><span>Accreditation decisions are made by <%= brand %>, separate from the providers we accredit.</span></div>
    <div><strong>Verifiable</strong><span>Every certificate carries a unique ID and a cryptographically signed QR code.</span></div>
    <div><strong>Accountable</strong><span>Revocation and provider status are shown on every verification.</span></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section white">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="center">How <%= brand %> accreditation works</h2>
    <p class="center muted">From accredited provider to verified credential in three steps.</p>
    <div class="grid g3 mt">
      <div class="card"><div class="step-n">1</div><h3>Provider accreditation</h3><p class="muted">Training organizations apply and are reviewed against <%= brand %> criteria for course content, instructors and assessment before they may issue.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="step-n">2</div><h3>Certificate issuance</h3><p class="muted">Accredited providers issue certificates by CSV upload or API. Each certificate carries the provider's brand and the <%= brand %> seal.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><div class="step-n">3</div><h3>Public verification</h3><p class="muted">Employers, clients and regulators scan the QR code or enter the ID to see live status: valid or revoked.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container grid g2">
    <div class="card"><h3>For employers &amp; HR</h3><p class="muted">Confirm a candidate's or contractor's training in seconds, without phone calls or emails to the training provider.</p><a href="/verify">Verify a certificate →</a></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>For training providers</h3><p class="muted">Give your graduates credentials that hold up to scrutiny, issued under your brand and backed by independent <%= brand %> verification.</p><a href="/accreditation">Explore the accreditation program →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
<%- include('../partials/foot') %>
